ssage:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the appropriate massage spot and pressure based on the magicians' reactions. Reckless touching of sensitive parts will cost you heavily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353290/extras/28e60dbce901170a5a28f2d723d048de.poster.avif?t=1773635591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353290/extras/28e60dbce901170a5a28f2d723d048de.webm?t=1773635591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353290/extras/28e60dbce901170a5a28f2d723d048de.mp4?t=1773635591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypnotic Guidance</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond intelligently to the hypnotized magician's nonsensical ramblings. (\u201cI'm going to lead a human-to-fish revolution!\u201d)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353290/extras/e4523c75c16006aca6c5ae60d599d3a2.poster.avif?t=1773635591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353290/extras/e4523c75c16006aca6c5ae60d599d3a2.webm?t=1773635591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353290/extras/e4523c75c16006aca6c5ae60d599d3a2.mp4?t=1773635591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock Management</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay up to date with current affairs, track market trends, and budget wisely to level-up fragrance powder and essential oils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 